
---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Read the Everyday Decision Tools privacy policy and learn how this website handles information, cookies, and optional analytics."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <div class="eyebrow">The details</div>
      <h1>Privacy <em>policy.</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated: November 5, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <article class="container narrow prose">
      <p>
        Everyday Decision Tools is designed to provide useful calculators
        with minimal data collection. This policy explains what information
        may be processed when you visit the website.
      </p>

      <h2>Calculator information</h2>
      <p>
        Calculator inputs and calculations run locally in your browser.
        The site does not send calculator values to a server, and it does
        not require an account or login. Avoid entering sensitive personal
        information into any calculator.
      </p>

      <h2>Server and hosting data</h2>
      <p>
        Our hosting provider may automatically process basic technical
        information, such as IP address, browser type, requested pages,
        and timestamps, in server logs for security, reliability, and
        operational purposes. The exact data retained depends on the
        hosting provider's policies.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This website uses Google Analytics 4 (GA4) as an optional analytics
        service to help us understand website traffic and visitor
        interactions so we can improve the site.
      </p>

      <p>
        Google Analytics is only loaded after you select
        <strong>Accept Analytics</strong> in the privacy preferences panel.
        If you select <strong>Reject Optional Analytics</strong>, the
        Google Analytics tag is not loaded.
      </p>

      <p>
        Your choice is stored in your browser's local storage so the
        website can remember your preference. You can reopen the privacy
        preferences panel at any time using the
        <strong>Privacy settings</strong> link in the website footer.
        If you withdraw a previous acceptance, the website saves your
        choice and reloads the page so that Google Analytics is no longer
        loaded.
      </p>

      <p>
        When enabled, Google Analytics may use cookies and similar
        technologies to collect information such as pages viewed,
        interactions, browser and device information, and approximate
        geographic information. Google processes this information under
        its own privacy terms.
      </p>

      <p>
        For more information, see
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Google's Privacy Policy
        </a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        Pages may link to external websites. We are not responsible for
        the privacy practices or content of those websites. Review their
        policies before sharing information with them.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This website is intended for a general audience and is not
        designed to knowingly collect personal information from children.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy as the website changes. The date at
        the top of this page indicates when it was most recently revised.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy can be sent to
        <a href="mailto:hello@everydaydecisiontools.com">
          hello@everydaydecisiontools.com
        </a>.
      </p>

      <p class="small-print">
        This policy describes the website's current practices and is
        general information, not legal advice.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
